; --- The twins' room ---------------------------------------------------------
; "They raised him in here." The family photograph from the lobby bench stands
; on the cot beside his bear, turned to the door. Twelve pencil marks climb the
; east wall: a child measured once a year, for the twelve years the player
; says they have been gone.
