; --- The chamber: "Here. With me." -----------------------------------------
; Under the giant clock, behind the dais, two covered bodies side by side with
; the family photograph and Mom's last recorder between them, its light dead.
; The same warm pool the lobby bench sits in, so the game opens and closes on
; the family. Against the back wall, so the fight on the dais is untouched.
[node name="Chamber" type="Node3D" parent="."]

